WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A promise can sound precise: twelve minutes, better focus, a changed mind.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
But precision is not proof. An experiment asks what happens against a fair comparison.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A seller offers a recording. Before the purchase, ask what files arrive,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
what evidence tests this exact product, and which terms govern your order.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try twelve quiet minutes with a reading first. Note interruptions and finished work.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
That's observation, not therapy or a clinical test. The question is not whether attention matters. It's what this particular purchase can actually establish.
